      "writtenOn": "2025-09-18T09:14:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To report more precisely which required HW features are missing may result in the code more complicated. e.g., mitigate_spectre_v2 relies on multiple hw features, and returning when detected the first missing hw feature is easy, but the other hw features may also be missed. If we want to print logs to show all the missed hw features, then probably should return later until all the hw feature checkings are done.\n\nMeanwhile, for the case that using if() to check multiple features, we need to split this if() to check single feature so that can precisely print the log?",
